fixture zone1_04_bypass_toss_wait
doc Known bypass, recorded and costed (docs/adr/0015, docs/feel_log/2026-10-19-zone1-b.md, review finding F1): the Ember Toss's 12 s cooldown can be waited out by bouncing on a spike post, so zone 1 room 4's alcove is reachable with no air dash after the hidden route's first three ground dashes. Four tosses in 2516 ticks (42 s), against the teaching route's 450 ticks (7.5 s)
room zone1/04_pogo_dash_reset
spawn 74 2336
frames 2526
input
  # The hidden route's own ground dashes to the tower (ticks 0 to 150), then no dash ever again. Per
  # post k to post k+1 (448 u up): a bounce, the air jump at its top, a drift away from the post to a
  # point 283 u short of the next post's column, the ember thrown up and across at the air jump's top
  # (it ends about 92 u over the next post), a fall back onto post k and bounces on it, the teleport
  # once the ember has flown (46 ticks after the throw), a bounce on post k+1, and bounces until the
  # toss is back (720 ticks after the throw); the last throw puts the ember in the alcove. Written by
  # a reactive scratch bot and compressed; the rhythm is not meant to be read tick by tick.
